<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #1170AE">BENEFITS &amp; INGREDIENTS</p>
<h2 id="benefits-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.3; color: #12324F">Functional ingredients<br>and key ingredients</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">For each function, we list the efficacy statement from the product labeling together with the ingredient responsible for it. Reported to Korea's Ministry of Food and Drug Safety (MFDS) in June 2025.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 560px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
<div style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; color: #12324F">UV protection</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Protects the skin from UV rays.</p>
</div>
<div style="border-top: 1px solid #D5E0E8; padding-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 14px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: #56626D">4 active ingredients (chemical filters)</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate <span style="color: #56626D">UVA</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Ethylhexyl Triazone <span style="color: #56626D">UVB</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Methylene Bis-Benzotriazolyl Tetramethylbutylphenol <span style="color: #56626D">UVA·UVB</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Diethylhexyl Butamido Triazone <span style="color: #56626D">UVB</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; color: #12324F">Brightening</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Helps brighten the skin.</p>
</div>
